{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rediscover the world from a new perspective: through the eyes of a cat!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Cat: Tales of Istanbul</i>\u00a0is a story-driven cat simulation where you experience the world through three very different kittens \u2014 a spoiled housecat, a charming stray, and a hardened survivor \u2014 each revealing a new side of Istanbul\u2019s soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/3601cfd30fd35de3b22886a542da8e3d.poster.avif?t=1762968653\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/3601cfd30fd35de3b22886a542da8e3d.webm?t=1762968653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live Three Cat Lives</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every kitten offers its own mood, gameplay, and a new story to uncover:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_R.png?t=1762968653\" /></span>\u00a0<strong>The White Cat \u2014 The Housecat:</strong> Your typical spoiled cat \u2014 entitled, adorable, and impossible to ignore. Knock things off tables, scratch furniture, demand affection, and walk away the moment you get it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life is easy, predictable\u2026 until it suddenly isn\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/eb57eaf9140197265e62bd95ec6df547.poster.avif?t=1762968653\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/eb57eaf9140197265e62bd95ec6df547.webm?t=1762968653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_L.png?t=1762968653\" /></span>\u00a0<strong>The Ginger Cat \u2014 The Stray:</strong> The flirty, charming heart of Istanbul \u2014 a street celebrity adored by everyone, yet belonging to no one. She strolls through markets, lounges on caf\u00e9 chairs, and wins treats with a purr and a tilt of her head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vendors feed her, tourists take her picture, locals call her by name \u2014 but no one takes her home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/c3c72624e348863e1d2e995c3f0a1cfd.poster.avif?t=1762968653\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/c3c72624e348863e1d2e995c3f0a1cfd.webm?t=1762968653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_R.png?t=1762968653\" /></span><strong>\u00a0The Black Cat \u2014 The Survivor:</strong> A shadow among the alleys \u2014 cautious, silent, and scarred. Life has never offered him safety, only lessons carved into his fur. He digs through garbage for scraps, steals from careless hands, and fights other strays for every mouse and patch of ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He doesn\u2019t trust people. He barely trusts himself. But one day, something will make him question that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/7d96367b6652370d28074b38155833ec.poster.avif?t=1762968653\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/7d96367b6652370d28074b38155833ec.webm?t=1762968653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Like a Real Cat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_L.png?t=1762968653\" /></span>\u00a0<strong>Walk, climb, sneak, and nap</strong> with natural feline movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_R.png?t=1762968653\" /></span><strong>\u00a0Meow and purr</strong> to communicate, distract, or charm humans and animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_L.png?t=1762968653\" /></span><strong>\u00a0</strong>Use enhanced <strong>feline senses</strong> to reveal scents, sounds, and hidden paths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_R.png?t=1762968653\" /></span><strong>\u00a0Mark territory</strong> and create checkpoints through scratching or rubbing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_L.png?t=1762968653\" /></span><strong>\u00a0Push, knock, and carry objects</strong> to solve small environmental puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/057e2d3382816ffe2b78071d5936eb4e.poster.avif?t=1762968653\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/057e2d3382816ffe2b78071d5936eb4e.webm?t=1762968653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Soul of Istanbul</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sunlit rooftops to rain-soaked alleys, Istanbul is alive with vendors, children, seagulls, and countless tiny stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter intertwines across the same city \u2014 familiar places look, sound, and feel new through another cat\u2019s eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/4ea06b952fcc612adbd90449fbffd5f9.poster.avif?t=1762968653\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/4ea06b952fcc612adbd90449fbffd5f9.webm?t=1762968653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cozy, Emotional, and Deeply Human</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the cozy fur and playful leaps lies a story about independence, empathy, and belonging \u2014 not just for cats, but for anyone searching for home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of <i>Stray</i>, <i>Spiritfarer</i>, <i>Little Kitty, Big City</i>, and <i>Endling</i>, blending cozy life-sim elements, story-rich exploration, and emotional narrative.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/15f643a9327d5fb4f23a8125793eaf84.avif?t=1762968653\" width=435 height=65 /></span></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574140?t=1762968653","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/d36bfb2e58e0420e91ee6729bd659c24f9766515/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762968653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/363b0c6aa2e41b0a91a953f5c75fbeb15b0c8fa2/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1762968653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/363b0c6aa2e41b0a91a953f5c75fbeb15b0c8fa2/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1762968653","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rediscover the world from a new perspective: through the eyes of a cat!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Cat: Tales of Istanbul</i>\u00a0is a story-driven cat simulation where you experience the world through three very different kittens \u2014 a spoiled housecat, a charming stray, and a hardened survivor \u2014 each revealing a new side of Istanbul\u2019s soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/3601cfd30fd35de3b22886a542da8e3d.poster.avif?t=1762968653\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/3601cfd30fd35de3b22886a542da8e3d.webm?t=1762968653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live Three Cat Lives</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every kitten offers its own mood, gameplay, and a new story to uncover:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_R.png?t=1762968653\" /></span>\u00a0<strong>The White Cat \u2014 The Housecat:</strong> Your typical spoiled cat \u2014 entitled, adorable, and impossible to ignore. Knock things off tables, scratch furniture, demand affection, and walk away the moment you get it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life is easy, predictable\u2026 until it suddenly isn\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/eb57eaf9140197265e62bd95ec6df547.poster.avif?t=1762968653\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/eb57eaf9140197265e62bd95ec6df547.webm?t=1762968653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_L.png?t=1762968653\" /></span>\u00a0<strong>The Ginger Cat \u2014 The Stray:</strong> The flirty, charming heart of Istanbul \u2014 a street celebrity adored by everyone, yet belonging to no one. She strolls through markets, lounges on caf\u00e9 chairs, and wins treats with a purr and a tilt of her head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vendors feed her, tourists take her picture, locals call her by name \u2014 but no one takes her home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/c3c72624e348863e1d2e995c3f0a1cfd.poster.avif?t=1762968653\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/c3c72624e348863e1d2e995c3f0a1cfd.webm?t=1762968653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_R.png?t=1762968653\" /></span><strong>\u00a0The Black Cat \u2014 The Survivor:</strong> A shadow among the alleys \u2014 cautious, silent, and scarred. Life has never offered him safety, only lessons carved into his fur. He digs through garbage for scraps, steals from careless hands, and fights other strays for every mouse and patch of ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He doesn\u2019t trust people. He barely trusts himself. But one day, something will make him question that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/7d96367b6652370d28074b38155833ec.poster.avif?t=1762968653\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/7d96367b6652370d28074b38155833ec.webm?t=1762968653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Like a Real Cat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_L.png?t=1762968653\" /></span>\u00a0<strong>Walk, climb, sneak, and nap</strong> with natural feline movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_R.png?t=1762968653\" /></span><strong>\u00a0Meow and purr</strong> to communicate, distract, or charm humans and animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_L.png?t=1762968653\" /></span><strong>\u00a0</strong>Use enhanced <strong>feline senses</strong> to reveal scents, sounds, and hidden paths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_R.png?t=1762968653\" /></span><strong>\u00a0Mark territory</strong> and create checkpoints through scratching or rubbing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_L.png?t=1762968653\" /></span><strong>\u00a0Push, knock, and carry objects</strong> to solve small environmental puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/057e2d3382816ffe2b78071d5936eb4e.poster.avif?t=1762968653\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/057e2d3382816ffe2b78071d5936eb4e.webm?t=1762968653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Soul of Istanbul</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sunlit rooftops to rain-soaked alleys, Istanbul is alive with vendors, children, seagulls, and countless tiny stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter intertwines across the same city \u2014 familiar places look, sound, and feel new through another cat\u2019s eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/4ea06b952fcc612adbd90449fbffd5f9.poster.avif?t=1762968653\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/4ea06b952fcc612adbd90449fbffd5f9.webm?t=1762968653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cozy, Emotional, and Deeply Human</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the cozy fur and playful leaps lies a story about independence, empathy, and belonging \u2014 not just for cats, but for anyone searching for home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of <i>Stray</i>, <i>Spiritfarer</i>, <i>Little Kitty, Big City</i>, and <i>Endling</i>, blending cozy life-sim elements, story-rich exploration, and emotional narrative.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/15f643a9327d5fb4f23a8125793eaf84.avif?t=1762968653\" width=435 height=65 /></span></h2>","developers":["The Kingsdom"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/5000190969a46750b6cb135b829e66fcc87c1c13/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1762968653","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"da